  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "After Hei Lou Lan’s tribulation, Tai Bai Yun Sheng reports her Immortal Gu: Flying Bear Strength Immortal Gu was given by Giant Sun’s will and is her vital Gu; she elevated her original core Gu, self strength Gu, to rank six; and she obtained a rank six strength qi Gu. Fang Yuan treats that list as confirmed Immortal Gu holdings, naming self strength Gu among them.",
        "chapters": [
          693
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_hei_lou_lan",
          "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "gu_flying_bear_strength_immortal_gu",
          "sys_vital_gu",
          "gu_strength_qi_immortal_gu",
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan notes that if he obtained it, he could use it as the core and elevate the power of myriad self by several levels.",
        "chapters": [
          765
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "myriad-self-compatibility",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Sources conflict:",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "myriad-self-compatibility",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The question is open.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "myriad-self-compatibility",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan demands Self Strength Immortal Gu as compensation for saving Hei Lou Lan, calling it extremely compatible with his immortal killer move myriad self. Fang Yuan recalls that she refined Self Strength Immortal Gu during her immortal ascension.",
        "chapters": [
          777
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "myriad-self-compatibility",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_immortal_ascension"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Hei Lou Lan hands the Gu over on the spot, and ownership changes.",
        "chapters": [
          778
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ownership-history",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Under a later agreement with Blazing Heaven Demoness’s side, he returns Self Strength Immortal Gu to Hei Lou Lan, and she refines it rapidly.",
        "chapters": [
          948
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ownership-history",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_blazing_heaven_demoness"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After Spring Autumn Cicada rebirth, his Immortal Gu inventory includes Self Strength again.",
        "chapters": [
          972
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ownership-history",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Sources conflict:",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ownership-history",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The question is open.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ownership-history",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When he offers it in a trade, the Gu carries huge significance for Hei Lou Lan, and she treats it as rank six.",
        "chapters": [
          974
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ownership-history",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He then trades Self Strength Immortal Gu for slavery Immortal Gu and a one year loan of attitude Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          975
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ownership-history",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_attitude_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In a later batch transfer he obtains Hei Lou Lan’s self strength Immortal Gu again.",
        "chapters": [
          1079
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ownership-history",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
